# Vercel Frontend Production Environment Variables
# 
# Instructions:
# 1. Set these values in your Vercel Dashboard (Settings → Environment Variables)
# 2. Do NOT commit this file with actual values
# 3. Replace YOUR_BACKEND_URL with your actual backend deployment URL
#
# Example:
# - If backend is at: https://tutorlink-backend.vercel.app
# - Set VITE_API_BASE_URL=https://tutorlink-backend.vercel.app/api
# - Set VITE_SOCKET_URL=https://tutorlink-backend.vercel.app
#

VITE_API_BASE_URL=https://tutorlink-backend-by58.onrender.com/api
VITE_SOCKET_URL=https://tutorlink-backend-by58.onrender.com
